  d="WORKER INFO EXCHANGE, BY NAME, ON GOOGLE'S AI OVERVIEW, SIGNED OUT, 2026-10-29: 'a non-profit organization based in London (operating also as Stichting WIE International) that fights for the digital and labor rights of gig economy workers.' Data control through subject access requests, algorithmic accountability, collective legal action against Uber's dynamic pay, research with the University of Oxford and the TUC. Four cards: its own site, two Stichting WIE International pages, a Facebook video.",
